  "admin.cambios.activar": "Turn on change control",
  "admin.cambios.activo": "On. After a valid password is typed, the session stays unlocked for {minutos} minutes and then asks again.",
  "admin.cambios.antes-exento": "The Owner used to be exempt, and a session of theirs left open could invoice without anyone confirming anything.",
  "admin.cambios.aplica-a-ti": "It applies to you too.",
  "admin.cambios.asignar": "Set password",
  "admin.cambios.cambiarla": "Change it",
  "admin.cambios.confirmar-activar": "From now on, EVERYONE —you included— will have to type their own password again for changes that move money or the catalog. Turn it on?",
  "admin.cambios.confirmar-desactivar": "Turn it off? Sensitive changes will no longer ask anyone for a password.",
  "admin.cambios.contrasena": "Change-control password",
  "admin.cambios.desactivar": "Turn off change control",
  "admin.cambios.explica": "Turn it on and changes that move money or the catalog —rates, rents, contracts, payments, invoicing and deleting screens, clients or landlords— will ask for a password: the person’s own, or the one you set below for the whole team. Day-to-day work —creating campaigns, uploading creatives, closing work orders— stays frictionless.",
  "admin.cambios.independiente": "Separate from each person’s sign-in password. It unlocks sensitive changes, but {no} resetting another person’s password — that always requires the password of the person doing it.",
